    description: Some("Thirsties are draining Kool-Aid Man\'s swimming pool through their straws, and he clears a round by bumping into all thirty before the water runs out. Swallowing a floating W, S or K makes him briefly bigger, immune to being knocked about, and tops the pool back up a little."),
